<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41324" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-τευκτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>able to attain</i> or <i>achieve,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕξις ἐ. τῶν βελτίστων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>MM</u>
					1199a8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Vit.</u>
				p.24J.
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνεσις ἐ. τοῦ μετρίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.12.5
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.74S.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <i>successful,
				effective,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paul.Aeg.
					3.78
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῆλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					10.22.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κόν, τό,</span>
			<i>spell, charm for securing success,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMag.Leid.W.
				8.28
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>advantageous, favourable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.29.3
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			).</div>
